{"seq":3,"slug":"rust-for-linux-kernel","title":"Rust for Linux 内核模块开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/systems/rust-for-linux-kernel","wordCount":636,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"rust-for-linux-内核模块开发\">Rust for Linux 内核模块开发</h1><p>2026 年 4 月，Linux 7.0 正式将 Rust 从 EXPERIMENTAL 提升为稳定特性。首个受益的子系统是 Driver Core——内核中最庞大也最脆弱的模块。Rust 通过三层抽象（bindgen 自动生成 → 手写安全封装 → 驱动开发者 API）成功嵌入了这个有 30 年历史的 C 代码基座，且 C 侧代码一行未改。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust in Linux 的架构遵循严格的分层原则：越往下越 unsafe（直接与 C 交互），越往上越 safe（驱动开发者面向的接口）。层间通过 <code>#[repr(transparent)]</code> 实现零成本指针互转。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[驱动开发者 Safe API] --&gt; B[rust/kernel 手写安全封装]&#10;    B --&gt; C[rust/bindings bindgen 自动生成]&#10;    C --&gt; D[C 侧内核代码 原封不动]&#10;    E[编译时: include/linux/*.h] --&gt;|bindgen| C&#10;    F[Arc Device / Attribute / RAII] --&gt; B&#10;    G[约 10 万行自动绑定] --&gt; C&#10;    H[struct device / kobject / sysfs] --&gt; D\">graph TB\n    A[驱动开发者 Safe API] --&gt; B[rust/kernel 手写安全封装]\n    B --&gt; C[rust/bindings bindgen 自动生成]\n    C --&gt; D[C 侧内核代码 原封不动]\n    E[编译时: include/linux/*.h] --&gt;|bindgen| C\n    F[Arc Device / Attribute / RAII] --&gt; B\n    G[约 10 万行自动绑定] --&gt; C\n    H[struct device / kobject / sysfs] --&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>unsafe 程度</th>\n<th>维护者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L4: 驱动 API</td>\n<td><code>kernel::driver::Registration</code></td>\n<td>完全 safe</td>\n<td>驱动作者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3: 安全封装</td>\n<td><code>Arc&lt;Device&gt;</code>, <code>kernel::sync</code></td>\n<td>内部 unsafe</td>\n<td>Rust-for-Linux 团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2: bindgen 绑定</td>\n<td><code>bindings::device_register()</code></td>\n<td>全部 unsafe</td>\n<td>自动生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1: C 内核</td>\n<td><code>struct device</code>, <code>kobject</code></td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>Greg KH 等 C 维护者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"引用计数自动化\">引用计数自动化</h2><p>内核中最常见的 bug 类别是引用计数错误——<code>kobject_get</code> 后忘记 <code>kobject_put</code> 导致内存泄漏，或 <code>put</code> 后继续使用导致 use-after-free。Rust 通过 <code>Arc&lt;Device&gt;</code> 封装将手动引用计数转化为编译器自动管理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[repr(transparent)]&#10;pub struct Device {&#10;    inner: Opaque&lt;bindings::device&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;// SAFETY: Device 的引用计数由内核 kobject 机制管理,&#10;// Arc 的 clone/drop 映射到 kobject_get/kobject_put&#10;unsafe impl AlwaysRefCounted for Device {&#10;    fn inc_ref(&amp;self) {&#10;        // 映射到 C 的 kobject_get&#10;        unsafe { bindings::kobject_get(&amp;(*self.inner.get()).kobj) };&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    unsafe fn dec_ref(obj: NonNull&lt;Self&gt;) {&#10;        // 映射到 C 的 kobject_put&#10;        unsafe { bindings::kobject_put(&amp;(*obj.as_ptr().cast::&lt;bindings::device&gt;()).kobj) };&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 驱动代码中：引用计数完全自动&#10;fn probe(dev: &amp;Device) -&gt; Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let dev_ref = dev.into_arc();  // kobject_get&#10;    // ... 使用 dev_ref ...&#10;    Ok(())&#10;    // dev_ref Drop 时自动 kobject_put&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[repr(transparent)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct Device {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    inner: Opaque&#x3C;bindings::device>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// SAFETY: Device 的引用计数由内核 kobject 机制管理,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Arc 的 clone/drop 映射到 kobject_get/kobject_put</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe impl AlwaysRefCounted for Device {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn inc_ref(&#x26;self) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 映射到 C 的 kobject_get</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        unsafe { bindings::kobject_get(&#x26;(*self.inner.get()).kobj) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unsafe fn dec_ref(obj: NonNull&#x3C;Self>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 映射到 C 的 kobject_put</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        unsafe { bindings::kobject_put(&#x26;(*obj.as_ptr().cast::&#x3C;bindings::device>()).kobj) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 驱动代码中：引用计数完全自动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn probe(dev: &#x26;Device) -> Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let dev_ref = dev.into_arc();  // kobject_get</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ... 使用 dev_ref ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // dev_ref Drop 时自动 kobject_put</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"驱动注册与-raii\">驱动注册与 RAII</h2><p>传统 C 驱动的 <code>probe</code>/<code>remove</code> 生命周期管理依赖程序员手动在每个错误路径释放资源。Rust 通过 RAII 模式将资源清理绑定到类型系统——注册即获得 guard，guard 销毁即注销。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use kernel::prelude::*;&#10;use kernel::pci;&#10;&#10;struct MyDriver {&#10;    irq: kernel::irq::Registration&lt;MyDriver&gt;,&#10;    mmio: kernel::io::IoMem&lt;4096&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl pci::Driver for MyDriver {&#10;    type Data = Arc&lt;MyDriver&gt;;&#10;&#10;    fn probe(dev: &amp;mut pci::Device, _info: &amp;pci::DeviceId) -&gt; Result&lt;Arc&lt;Self&gt;&gt; {&#10;        // 映射 MMIO 区域&#10;        let bar = dev.iomap_region(0, c_str!(&quot;my_driver&quot;))?;&#10;&#10;        // 注册中断——返回 Registration guard&#10;        let irq = dev.request_irq(Self::handle_irq)?;&#10;&#10;        Ok(Arc::new(Self { irq, mmio: bar }, GFP_KERNEL)?)&#10;        // 如果任何步骤失败，已分配的资源通过 Drop 自动释放&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Drop for MyDriver {&#10;    fn drop(&amp;mut self) {&#10;        pr_info!(&quot;驱动卸载，资源自动清理\\n&quot;);&#10;        // irq.drop() → free_irq&#10;        // mmio.drop() → iounmap&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use kernel::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use kernel::pci;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct MyDriver {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    irq: kernel::irq::Registration&#x3C;MyDriver>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mmio: kernel::io::IoMem&#x3C;4096>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl pci::Driver for MyDriver {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Data = Arc&#x3C;MyDriver>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn probe(dev: &#x26;mut pci::Device, _info: &#x26;pci::DeviceId) -> Result&#x3C;Arc&#x3C;Self>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 映射 MMIO 区域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let bar = dev.iomap_region(0, c_str!(\"my_driver\"))?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 注册中断——返回 Registration guard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let irq = dev.request_irq(Self::handle_irq)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(Arc::new(Self { irq, mmio: bar }, GFP_KERNEL)?)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 如果任何步骤失败，已分配的资源通过 Drop 自动释放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Drop for MyDriver {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn drop(&#x26;mut self) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pr_info!(\"驱动卸载，资源自动清理\\n\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // irq.drop() → free_irq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // mmio.drop() → iounmap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"内核同步原语的-rust-封装\">内核同步原语的 Rust 封装</h2><p>内核提供的同步原语（spinlock、mutex、rcu）在 Rust 侧通过类型系统强制正确使用。例如，<code>SpinLock</code> 的 guard 类型在持有锁期间禁止 <code>.await</code>（因为自旋锁不允许休眠）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use kernel::sync::{SpinLock, Mutex, Arc};&#10;use kernel::new_spinlock;&#10;&#10;struct SharedState {&#10;    counter: u64,&#10;    buffer: Vec&lt;u8&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;// pin_init! 宏处理内核内存分配器的错误路径&#10;let state = Arc::pin_init(pin_init!(SharedState {&#10;    counter: 0,&#10;    buffer: Vec::new(),&#10;}), GFP_KERNEL)?;&#10;&#10;let lock = new_spinlock!(state, &quot;my_driver::state&quot;);&#10;&#10;// Guard 类型保证：&#10;// 1. 锁一定会释放（RAII）&#10;// 2. 只能通过 guard 访问被保护的数据&#10;// 3. 编译器阻止在持有 spinlock 时调用可能休眠的函数&#10;{&#10;    let mut guard = lock.lock();&#10;    guard.counter += 1;&#10;}  // 自动解锁\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use kernel::sync::{SpinLock, Mutex, Arc};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use kernel::new_spinlock;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct SharedState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    counter: u64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buffer: Vec&#x3C;u8>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// pin_init! 宏处理内核内存分配器的错误路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let state = Arc::pin_init(pin_init!(SharedState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    counter: 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buffer: Vec::new(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}), GFP_KERNEL)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let lock = new_spinlock!(state, \"my_driver::state\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Guard 类型保证：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. 锁一定会释放（RAII）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. 只能通过 guard 访问被保护的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3. 编译器阻止在持有 spinlock 时调用可能休眠的函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut guard = lock.lock();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    guard.counter += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}  // 自动解锁</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"构建系统与工具链\">构建系统与工具链</h2><p>Rust 内核代码使用 Linux 的 Kbuild 系统构建，而非 Cargo。编译器版本由内核指定（当前为 rustc 1.82+），不允许使用 crates.io 的外部依赖。所有 Rust 代码只能依赖 <code>core</code>、<code>alloc</code>（受限的内核分配器版本）和内核自身的 <code>rust/kernel/</code> 模块。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"makefile\" data-code=\"# drivers/my_driver/Kbuild&#10;obj-$(CONFIG_MY_DRIVER) += my_driver.o&#10;my_driver-y := my_driver_main.o&#10;&#10;# Kconfig&#10;config MY_DRIVER&#10;    tristate &quot;My Rust Driver&quot;&#10;    depends on RUST&#10;    help&#10;      A sample Rust driver using the kernel framework.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># drivers/my_driver/Kbuild</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>obj-$(CONFIG_MY_DRIVER) += my_driver.o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>my_driver-y := my_driver_main.o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Kconfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>config MY_DRIVER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tristate \"My Rust Driver\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    depends on RUST</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    help</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      A sample Rust driver using the kernel framework.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>开发者工具链设置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 验证 Rust 支持是否启用&#10;make LLVM=1 rustavailable&#10;&#10;# 生成 Rust 分析器配置（IDE 支持）&#10;make LLVM=1 rust-analyzer\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证 Rust 支持是否启用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> LLVM=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rustavailable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成 Rust 分析器配置（IDE 支持）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> LLVM=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rust-analyzer</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Linux 7.0 中 Rust 毕业为稳定特性，覆盖 74 个内核子系统抽象</li>\n<li>三层架构保证 C 侧零修改：bindgen 自动生成 → 手写安全封装 → 驱动 API</li>\n<li><code>Arc&lt;Device&gt;</code> 将手动引用计数转为编译器自动管理，消除 use-after-free</li>\n<li>RAII 驱动注册保证所有错误路径都正确释放资源</li>\n<li>内核 Rust 使用 Kbuild 而非 Cargo，不允许外部 crate 依赖</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章上一篇 <a href=\"async-runtime-internals\">异步运行时内部机制</a> 覆盖用户态运行时的调度设计</li>\n<li>跨库参考：<a href=\"../../rust-language/systems-programming/unsafe-and-ffi\">Rust 语言 - unsafe 与 FFI</a> 覆盖 FFI 基础知识</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Rust for Linux 内核模块开发","id":"rust-for-linux-内核模块开发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"引用计数自动化","id":"引用计数自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"驱动注册与 RAII","id":"驱动注册与-raii"},{"level":2,"text":"内核同步原语的 Rust 封装","id":"内核同步原语的-rust-封装"},{"level":2,"text":"构建系统与工具链","id":"构建系统与工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"异步运行时内部机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/systems/async-runtime-internals"},"next":{"title":"no_std 环境与裸机编程模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/no-std-fundamentals"}}